# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and adjust.
# Optional admin (user `admin`, or STREAMHUB_ADMIN_USER). Without it, the first start prints a setup link
# (docker compose logs) that creates the admin account in the browser.
# STREAMHUB_ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me
# STREAMHUB_SLACK_HOOK=https://hooks.slack.com/services/...
# STREAMHUB_COOKIE_SECRET=a-long-random-string
# The config folder inside the container (./config is mounted at /config):
# STREAMHUB_CONFIG=/config
# Group that owns /var/run/docker.sock on the host (Linux: getent group docker | cut -d: -f3); 0 on Docker Desktop:
# DOCKER_GID=999
